Title: crypto/x509: Get "[URL] tls: failed to verify certificate: SecPolicyCreateSSL error: 0 when running in child after parent exits

Body: THIS IS UNRELATED TO [URL]

### Go version

go version go1.22.5 darwin/arm64

### Output of `go env` in your module/workspace:

```shell
GO111MODULE=''
